    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --bg: #0a0a0f;\n    --surface: #13131a;\n    --card: #1a1a24;\n    --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);\n    --text: #f0f0f5;\n    --muted: #8888aa;\n    --accent: #6c63ff;\n    --google-blue: #4285f4;\n    --meta-blue: #1877f2;\n    --green: #22c55e;\n  }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; padding: 40px; }\n  .header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 28px; margin-bottom: 36px; }\n  .label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }\n  .meta-row { display: flex; gap: 24px; margin-top: 10px; }\n  .badge { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }\n  .badge.status { background: rgba(108,99,255,0.12); border-color: rgba(108,99,255,0.3); color: var(--accent); }\n  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 32px; }\n  .stat-card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; }\n  .stat-num { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }\n  .stat-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }\n  .stat-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--green); margin-top: 6px; font-weight: 500; }\n  .channels { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 32px; }\n  .channel-card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; }\n  .channel-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  .channel-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }\n  .channel-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .channel-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }\n  .channel-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .channel-key { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }\n  .channel-val { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }\n  .section-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .note { background: rgba(108,99,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(108,99,255,0.2); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 18px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .note strong { color: var(--text); }\n  .bar-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .bar-label { width: 60px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }\n  .bar-track { flex: 1; height: 6px; background: var(--border); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .bar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; }\n  .bar-pct { width: 36px; text-align: right; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text); }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"label\" data-adf-id=\"client-label\">Client Campaign Brief</div>\n  <h1 data-adf-id=\"campaign-title\">FitLux — Q3 AirFlex Launch</h1>\n  <div class=\"meta-row\">\n    <span class=\"badge\" data-adf-id=\"campaign-period\">July – September 2026</span>\n    <span class=\"badge\" data-adf-id=\"target-audience\">Women 24–38 · IE + UK</span>\n    <span class=\"badge status\" data-adf-id=\"campaign-status-badge\">Planned</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">Summary Metrics</div>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n  <div class=\"stat-card\">\n    <div class=\"stat-num\" data-adf-id=\"total-budget\">€8,000</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-label\">Total Budget</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-sub\">Google 60% · Meta 40%</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stat-card\">\n    <div class=\"stat-num\" data-adf-id=\"projected-conversions\">179</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-label\">Projected Sales</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-sub\">Target: 150 — surplus of 29</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stat-card\">\n    <div class=\"stat-num\" data-adf-id=\"projected-revenue\">€15,215</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-label\">Projected Revenue</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-sub\">ROAS 1.9× at €85 AOV</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stat-card\">\n    <div class=\"stat-num\" data-adf-id=\"blended-cpa\">€44.69</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-label\">Blended Target CPA</div>\n    <div class=\"stat-sub\">Google €52 · Meta €37</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">Budget Allocation</div>\n<div style=\"background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:32px;\">\n  <div class=\"bar-row\">\n    <div class=\"bar-label\">Google</div>\n    <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-fill\" style=\"width:60%;background:var(--google-blue);\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bar-pct\" data-adf-id=\"google-pct\">60%</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bar-row\">\n    <div class=\"bar-label\">Meta</div>\n    <div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-fill\" style=\"width:40%;background:var(--meta-blue);\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bar-pct\" data-adf-id=\"meta-pct\">40%</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n    <strong>Rationale:</strong> Google captures high-intent search traffic (\"activewear Ireland\", \"performance leggings\") where the premium price point converts well. Meta drives discovery and remarketing for an audience that doesn't yet know FitLux. CPC advantage on Meta (€0.85 vs €1.20) doesn't offset the lower purchase intent — Google gets the bigger share.\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"channels\">\n  <div class=\"channel-card\">\n    <div class=\"channel-header\">\n      <div class=\"channel-dot\" style=\"background:var(--google-blue)\"></div>\n      <div class=\"channel-title\" data-adf-id=\"google-title\">Google Ads</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Budget</span><span class=\"channel-val\" data-adf-id=\"google-budget\">€4,800</span></div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Est. CPC</span><span class=\"channel-val\">€1.20</span></div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Est. Clicks</span><span class=\"channel-val\" data-adf-id=\"google-clicks\">4,000</span></div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Conv. Rate</span><span class=\"channel-val\">2.3%</span></div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Est. Sales</span><span class=\"channel-val\" data-adf-id=\"google-conversions\">92</span></div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Target CPA</span><span class=\"channel-val\" data-adf-id=\"google-cpa\">€52.17</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"channel-card\">\n    <div class=\"channel-header\">\n      <div class=\"channel-dot\" style=\"background:var(--meta-blue)\"></div>\n      <div class=\"channel-title\" data-adf-id=\"meta-title\">Meta Ads</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Budget</span><span class=\"channel-val\" data-adf-id=\"meta-budget\">€3,200</span></div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Est. CPC</span><span class=\"channel-val\">€0.85</span></div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Est. Clicks</span><span class=\"channel-val\" data-adf-id=\"meta-clicks\">3,765</span></div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Conv. Rate</span><span class=\"channel-val\">2.3%</span></div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Est. Sales</span><span class=\"channel-val\" data-adf-id=\"meta-conversions\">87</span></div>\n    <div class=\"channel-row\"><span class=\"channel-key\">Target CPA</span><span class=\"channel-val\" data-adf-id=\"meta-cpa\">€36.78</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
